    ShiciStateV3 "1" *-- "1" Profile : profile
    ShiciStateV3 "1" *-- "1" StateMeta : meta
    ShiciStateV3 "1" o-- "0..*" WordProgress : words keyed by wordId
    StudyController "1" *-- "0..1" StudySession : active session
    SessionPlanner ..> BookCatalog : chooses words
    SessionPlanner ..> SRSEngine : due policy
    ReportMetrics ..> SRSEngine : mastery policy
    StateStore --> IDBBackup : asynchronous backup
    StateStore --> SyncTransport : optional remote
    SyncTransport <|.. LocalDaemonSync : implements
    StateStore --> SRSEngine : writes learning evidence
    StateStore --> SessionPlanner : exposes queues
    StateStore --> ReportMetrics : exposes reports
    StudyController --> StateStore : Store facade
    StudyController --> SessionPlanner : seven word plan
    StudyController --> ViewRenderer : renders session
    StudyController --> TTSService : reads word aloud
    Router --> ViewRenderer : renders routes
    Router --> StateStore : read only view data
